 14px\"><span class=\"btn btn-text\" style=\"padding:4px 8px;font-size:12px\">+ Add alarm</span></div>\n    </div>"],"anatomy":{"demo":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"box\"><span class=\"tp-box\">14:30<i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"col\"><span class=\"tp-panel\"><span class=\"tp-col\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"item\"><span class=\"tp-item\">13</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"sel\"><span class=\"tp-item on\">14</span></span><span class=\"tp-item\">15</span></span></span></span>","demo_en":"<span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"box\"><span class=\"tp-box\">14:30<i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"col\"><span class=\"tp-panel\"><span class=\"tp-col\"><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"item\"><span class=\"tp-item\">13</span></span><span class=\"ap\" data-ap=\"sel\"><span class=\"tp-item on\">14</span></span><span class=\"tp-item\">15</span></span></span></span>","parts":[{"key":"box","cn":"触发框","en":"Trigger","desc":"显示已选时间","desc_en":"Shows the selected time"},{"key":"col","cn":"时间列","en":"Time Column","desc":"小时、分钟各一列，可滚动","desc_en":"Scrollable columns for hours and minutes"},{"key":"item","cn":"时间项","en":"Time Option","desc":"一个可选的时刻","desc_en":"An available time"},{"key":"sel","cn":"选中项","en":"Selected","desc":"当前时间，居中高亮","desc_en":"The selected time, highlighted in the center"}]},"variants":[{"cn":"24 小时制","en":"24-hour","demo":"<div class=\"tp-panel\"><div class=\"tp-col\"><span class=\"tp-item\">13</span><span class=\"tp-item on\">14</span><span class=\"tp-item\">15</span></div><span class=\"tp-sep\">:</span><div class=\"tp-col\"><span class=\"tp-item\">00</span><span class=\"tp-item on\">30</span><span class=\"tp-item\">45</span></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"tp-panel\"><div class=\"tp-col\"><span class=\"tp-item\">13</span><span class=\"tp-item on\">14</span><span class=\"tp-item\">15</span></div><span class=\"tp-sep\">:</span><div class=\"tp-col\"><span class=\"tp-item\">00</span><span class=\"tp-item on\">30</span><span class=\"tp-item\">45</span></div></div>","when":"会议和定时任务需要避免上午、下午歧义时","when_en":"When meetings and scheduled tasks need an unambiguous time format"},{"cn":"时间范围","en":"Range","demo":"<div class=\"tp-range\"><div class=\"tp-box\">09:00</div><em>→</em><div class=\"tp-box\">18:00</div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"tp-range\"><div class=\"tp-box\">09:00</div><em>→</em><div class=\"tp-box\">18:00</div></div>","when":"要选开始和结束的一对时间","when_en":"Choose a start and end time"},{"cn":"12 小时制","en":"12-hour","demo":"<div class=\"tp-panel\"><div class=\"tp-col\"><span class=\"tp-item\">01</span><span class=\"tp-item on\">02</span><span class=\"tp-item\">03</span></div><span class=\"tp-sep\">:</span><div class=\"tp-col\"><span class=\"tp-item on\">30</span><span class=\"tp-item\">45</span></div><div class=\"tp-col\"><span class=\"tp-item\">AM</span><span class=\"tp-item on\">PM</span></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"tp-panel\"><div class=\"tp-col\"><span class=\"tp-item\">01</span><span class=\"tp-item on\">02</span><span class=\"tp-item\">03</span></div><span class=\"tp-sep\">:</span><div class=\"tp-col\"><span class=\"tp-item on\">30</span><span class=\"tp-item\">45</span></div><div class=\"tp-col\"><span class=\"tp-item\">AM</span><span class=\"tp-item on\">PM</span></div></div>","when":"面向习惯上午下午说法的用户","when_en":"When users prefer AM/PM time"},{"cn":"固定步长","en":"Step","demo":"<div class=\"tp-panel\"><div class=\"tp-col\"><span class=\"tp-item\">09:00</span><span class=\"tp-item on\">09:30</span><span class=\"tp-item\">10:00</span><span class=\"tp-item\">10:30</span></div></div>","demo_en":"<div class=\"tp-panel\"><div class=\"tp-col\"><span class=\"tp-item\">09:00</span><span class=\"tp-item on\">09:30</span><span class=\"tp-item\">10:00</span><span class=\"tp-item\">10:30</span></div></div>","when":"按业务允许的时间间隔提供选项","when_en":"When availability is limited to approved time slots"}],"use":[{"t":"<b>会议 / 日程的开始时间</b>","m":"tp-meeting"},{"t":"<b>营业时间等时间段</b>：开始 + 结束一对","m":"tp-range"},{"t":"<b>定时任务</b>：每天几点自动执行","m":"tp-cron"},{"t":"<b>按业务步长选择</b>：例如预约服务按半小时提供时段","m":"tp-step"}],"dont":[{"t":"还需要<b>选择日期</b>：使用 {c:date-picker} 的日期时间模式","m":"tp-datetime","bad":true},{"t":"只需<b>上午 / 下午等粗粒度时段</b>：使用 {c:select}","m":"tp-coarse","bad":true},{"t":"<b>允许自由输入自然语言时间</b>：系统难以稳定解析，应提供结构化选项","m":"tp-text","bad":true},{"t":"<b>跨时区场景不标时区</b>：相同时间在不同地区会对应不同时刻","m":"tp-timezone","bad":true}],"lessonPractice":{"title":"用户要预约纽约团队的会议，时段按 30 分钟开放，部分时间已满。怎样让时间选择不产生歧义？","options":[{"id":"structured-zoned-slots","label":"提供半小时步长的时间选择器，禁用已满时段，并明确显示纽约时区","feedback":"结构化时段控制格式和可用范围，时区说明让不同地区用户理解选择对应的真实时刻。","correct":true},{"id":"free-language-time","label":"提供文本框，让用户输入“明早”或“下午三点左右”","feedback":"自然语言无法稳定对应半小时预约位，不同地区对“明早”的理解也可能不同。","correct":false},{"id":"local-time-without-zone","label":"只显示 09:00、09:30 等时间，不说明它属于哪个地区","feedback":"选项看似精确，但跨地区用户可能按自己的本地时间理解，最终预约到错误时刻。","correct":false}],"en":{"title":"A user books a meeting with a New York team. Slots are every 30 minutes and some are full. How can time selection avoid ambiguity?","options":[{"id":"structured-zoned-slots","label":"Use a 30-minute time picker, disable full slots, and explicitly show the New York time zone","feedback":"Structured slots control format and availability, while the zone tells users in other regions what instant they selected.","correct":true},{"id":"free-language-time","label":"Use a text field and accept phrases such as tomorrow morning or around three","feedback":"Natural language cannot map reliably to 30-minute inventory, and tomorrow morning differs across regions.","correct":false},{"id":"local-time-without-zone","label":"Show 09:00 and 09:30 options without saying which region they belong to","feedback":"The values look precise, but remote users may interpret them in their own local time and book the wrong instant.","correct":false}]}},"lessonAgentPrompt":{"title":"你可以这样告诉 AI Agent","text":"请把会议时间做成 30 分钟步长的选择器，已满和营业时间外不可选，并持续显示 America/New_York 及用户本地换算。测试夏令时切换、无可用时段和修改日期后的状态更新。","en":{"title":"You can say this to an AI Agent","text":"Use a 30-minute meeting time picker, disable full and out-of-hours slots, and continuously show America/New_York plus the user's local conversion. Test daylight-saving changes, no availability, and state updates after changing the date."}},"references":[{"title":"<input type=\"time\">：时间输入控件","source":"MDN","url":"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/input/time","title_en":"<input type=\"time\">"}],"scenes":["会议时间设置","门店营业时间","定时推送","闹钟提醒"],"en":{"use":[{"t":"Appointment time","m":"tp-meeting"},{"t":"Reminder time","m":"tp-range"},{"t":"Business hours","m":"tp-cron"},{"t":"Schedule with fixed time steps","m":"tp-step"}],"dont":[{"t":"Ask for seconds when that precision is not useful","m":"tp-datetime","bad":true},{"t":"Mix 12-hour and 24-hour formats","m":"tp-coarse","bad":true},{"t":"Offer unavailable times and reject them later","m":"tp-text","bad":true},{"t":"Hide the relevant time zone","m":"tp-timezone","bad":true}],"scenes":["Meeting booking","Reminder","Store hours","Scheduled task"],"sceneUI":["<div style=\"display:flex;gap:10px;max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;align-items:flex-start\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;background:var(--bg);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:10px;padding:10px 12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow-card)\">\n        <b style=\"font-size:13px\">New meeting</b>\n        <input class=\"demo-input\" style=\"width:100%;margin:8px 0;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px\" value=\"Product Weekly Meeting · Q3 Planning Alignment\">\n        <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px\">\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-2)\">Time</span>\n          <span class=\"tp-box\" style=\"font-size:12px;padding:5px 9px\">14:30<i class=\"select-arrow\"></i></span>\n          <span style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--text-3)\">Today · About 1 hour</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=